<%- include('dash-header') %><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">A LITTLE MORE MIND</p><h1>Think it through.</h1><p class="heading-description">Bring the question. Brain brings the context you’ve chosen to share.</p></div><span class="thought-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div><div class="thinking-grid"><section class="dash-panel compose-panel"><% if(error) { %><p role="alert" class="message error"><%= error %></p><% } %><% if(!aiReady) { %><div class="dash-notice warning">Thinking is not available yet. Your memory and assistant connections are still here.</div><% } %><form method="post" action="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/think') %>" class="compose-form" data-pending-label="Thinking…"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label for="thought-text">What’s on your mind?</label><textarea id="thought-text" name="text" rows="7" maxlength="32000" placeholder="Ask a question. Untangle an idea. Pick up a thought from before…" required><%= text %></textarea><fieldset class="choice-row"><legend>Give it a little time</legend><label><input type="radio" name="depth" value="quick" <%- depth==='quick'?'checked':'' %>><span><strong>A quick thought</strong><small>A focused answer in a few seconds.</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="depth" value="deep" <%- depth==='deep'?'checked':'' %>><span><strong>Think deeper</strong><small>More room for a layered question.</small></span></label></fieldset><div class="compose-actions"><button class="dash-button lime" type="submit" <%- !aiReady?'disabled':'' %>>Think with Brain ✳</button><a href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs/new') %>" class="panel-link">Need more time? Start a task ↗</a></div></form></section><aside class="dash-panel thinking-note"><span>✳</span><h2>Context makes the difference.</h2><p>Brain can draw on your saved facts, notes, handoffs, and snapshots to help you see a little further.</p><p>If a question needs more time, it can keep working in the background. You can come back to the result.</p><a href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/memory') %>" class="panel-link">See what Brain remembers ↗</a></aside></div><% if(answer) { %><section class="dash-panel answer-panel" aria-live="polite"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="overline">A THOUGHT TO TAKE WITH YOU</p><h2>Here’s where that leads.</h2></div><span class="answer-symbol">✳</span></div><pre class="memory-content"><%= answer %></pre><% if(trailer) { %><p class="answer-trailer"><%= trailer %></p><% } %><% if(jobId) { %><a class="dash-button outline" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs/'+jobId) %>">Follow the background task ↗</a><% } %></section><% } %><%- include('dash-footer') %>
